LESSONS LEARNED 

descending Mines: grab a pick-axe, or carefully track where the lowest one is
  ...Mine's End can be Wine Cellar and you'll need to dig
Gnome King's Wine Cellar: a monster may be generated in the gem vault
  ...who will grab gray stones and mix them up! beware loadstone
  ...dig around the room to make space to kick
co-aligned unicorns are *special*, with regards to losing "peaceful" status
  ...killing them gets "You feel guilty." message, apparently means luck -5?
still having trouble picturing where brachport will take me
  ...from lower Dungeon levels/Gehennom -> Quest = *lowest* Quest lvl
  ...also: pets must be *adjacent* (even if leashed), or they're left behind
if wearing blindfold, you won't see succubus "headache" messages
the pick-axe/fountain trick: those "pools" are water just like any other
  ...some diluted potions/blanked scrolls *even* the ones in the (oH :-(
     ...presumably greasing the (oH help this?
  ...wands and rings can rust too (don't be carrying them)
  ...you can get blessed/cursed paper, but not unholy water, using drowning
maneuver powerful peacefuls spawned by ^magic next to trap, try again
  ...if Cha boost, will charm adjacent; voila, your pet
demiliches are *dangerous* because of rapid-fire summons
  ...can become surrounded by horde on a no-teleport level
  ...not to mention cold resist (no +oCoCold)
  ...don't forget: #invoke Eye works on non-teleport levels?
put most of the gold away (but not all) at Asmodeus/Baalzebub lair
argh--don't throw +7 daggers at a disenchanter (duh)
mind flayer "It feels quite soothing." ??
eating tinned food can make fingers greasy
  ...one reason to swap blindfold for towel, given the chance
  ...but greasy fingers wears off by itself after a few turns
fighting an umber hulk: watch for (and cure) confusion if near water
  ...can misstep and fall in
once you reach XL17, you aren't going to get to XL18 by normal XP
  ...so may as well quaff all !oGL at that point
read about "wraith luring" in food spoiler: lead them from Castle/graveyard
remember: Anhur gives +oDeath upon crowning (if Stormbringer already exists?)
  ...so don't spend MM charges for it; do sacfest instead
=oFA protects from chest traps?
on Plane of Air
  ..."Kaboom!!!" is lightning (1/8 chance) which paralyzes you a few turns
     ...+oDeath or /oDeath on air-E if engulfed, or risk many debris hits
  ...when in the clouds, can't see air-E approaching (telepathy neither)
     ...go around the clouds, so you can see air-E coming and /oTeleport
on Plane of Water, +oCoCold doesn't work (even within the air bubble)


